    "headline": "Waste Management (NYSE:WM) Posts Q2 CY2026 Sales In Line With Estimates",
    "summary": "Waste management services provider Waste Management (NYSE:WM) met Wall Street’s revenue expectations in Q2 CY2026, with sales up 4% year on year to $6.68 billion. On the other hand, the company’s full-year revenue guidance of $26.38 billion at the midpoint came in 0.6% below analysts’ estimates. Its non-GAAP profit of $2.02 per share was 2.1% above analysts’ consensus estimates.",
